00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:30.030
We live in a world

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:32.160
where there's an entire secretive industry

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.680
dedicated to collecting
information about you

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.570
and no, this isn't the NSA spying on you.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:39.690
This is for-profit
corporations who spy on you

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:42.180
in any way they can, so they can sell that

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:44.700
to other companies who
